<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/app.css" />
    <title>quintal · algo deu errado</title>
    <style>
      body {
        margin: 0;
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        background: var(--fundo, #faf6f1);
        color: var(--tinta, #2e2833);
        font-family: var(--fonte-chrome, "atkinson hyperlegible"), system-ui, sans-serif;
        text-align: center;
      }
      main {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 1rem;
        max-width: 32rem;
        padding: 2rem;
      }
      img { width: 10rem; height: auto; }
      h1 { font-size: 1.25rem; }
      a { color: var(--acento, #7663ab); }
      @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
        body { background: #1d1923; color: #e8e2ee; }
        a { color: #a493cc; }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <img src="/images/axo-sitting.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="415" height="420" />
      <h1>ih, algo deu errado. tenta de novo?</h1>
      <a href="/" class="botao botao--fantasma">voltar pro quintal</a>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
